{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7d27ac775c23e26f5be60f619dcfb76e59bf7936e8bd40dd9f0f046ed7f1f56a", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日だ。\nそろそろ風花の着替えが終わる頃だが……）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的日子。\n风花差不多该换好衣服了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a2aa266a4d51b8594768ac23025bfe5aec40bd0d164a6d41896e45fc9f3a5481", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nお、お待たせしました……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n让您久等了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1002_p", "source_sha256": "adb16915c90bd4e7a0b934011c37d9ba017eac196b62c3153570461ccd6e1143", "ja": "おおっ、やっぱり似合うな……って、風花？\n表情が硬いけど、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "哦哦，果然很适合你……呃，风花？\n表情很僵硬，是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8ea0f146d461e2a567be0345892e1aab011bae4269b4c9625911334a353de376", "ja": "これって、セクシーな女スパイの衣装なんですよね？\nうぅ……セクシーなだけじゃなくて、スパイ……。", "zh": "这套衣服是性感女间谍的服装，对吧？\n呜呜……不只是性感，还要当间谍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b7da688a26af80e3eda925bf937831f6d2ea99250f69949b6fad708c2fed9839", "ja": "女スパイって、スタイリッシュさも必要ですよね？\n私にできるのか不安で……。", "zh": "女间谍也得显得帅气干练才行吧？\n我心里很不安，不知道自己能不能演好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a5838896c721fb6a43992eb2554eed02fcd81c2c733649daea89dd3ba6bf2653", "ja": "確かに。映画とかだと女スパイって、\nかっこいいアクションでも活躍したりするしな。", "zh": "确实。电影里的女间谍，\n有时候也会用帅气的动作戏大显身手呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ac59d797733c5c499ae1a22aaedb89fa063a4cc139201ff5e86045907c75dc14", "ja": "はい、私も映画で勉強したんですけど、\nスニークミッションとか、ガンアクションとか……。", "zh": "是的，我也是从电影里学的，比如潜入任务、枪战动作什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "eb549b56bbd94ca864f6ad45d549f3a8430a00632e55a534ca611bc4da6d64c7", "ja": "それに、大胆な誘惑術も……う、うぅっ……。\n私にはそんなセクシースパイは無理です～！", "zh": "而且还有大胆的诱惑术……呜、呜呜……  \n我做不到那种性感间谍啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8ac29c6d7c7f1237d3d1f2e31de0bee420330b6f4a585afd317653ae07c0e350", "ja": "そんなに意識しなくても大丈夫だと思うけど。\n風花なりに着てくれれば、それで十分だよ。", "zh": "我觉得不用那么在意也没关系。\n只要穿出风花自己的风格，就足够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7da6dffee9bcd4e18b24021399492c49505940744f447b501abbb4b84dde9200", "ja": "でも、それでみんなが求めているセクシースパイに\nなれるんでしょうか……。", "zh": "可是，这样真的能成为大家所期待的性感间谍吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9e69bbe3cbb097faff80ebb058e8741e20282ead4adb200e284941623c87c5d7", "ja": "なるほど。じゃあ、ちょっと気分を変えて……風花が\n映画を見て、特に気に入ったシーンってあるのか？", "zh": "原来如此。那就换换心情……风花有没有看电影时特别喜欢的场景？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "be8f31848febeaa048e63c59691c79d9fa44ece713c438e9565403b1d71f788e", "ja": "え？　えっと……狡猾なスパイが、\nあえてストレートに攻めるところ、でしょうか？", "zh": "咦？这个嘛……应该是狡猾的间谍故意采取直球攻势的那一幕吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1012_p", "source_sha256": "bc37a29e42cc9ab5fe1a3c2994a8db2ab332e0a76dfa680173f89b9f0c6bf1aa", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……。\nよかったら、そのシーンを真似してみてくれるか？", "zh": "嗯——，是啊……。\n如果你愿意的话，能模仿一下那个场景吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a87a876a81b96fca854d7ea359ab578d132f584976354822f053aae8c91ef664", "ja": "え、今ですか？　そんな急に……。で、でも\n{$P$}さんが言うなら……こほん。", "zh": "咦，现在吗？这么突然……可、可是，既然{$P$}先生这么说……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "98d73a8207ed8037beb75601705806b886c5a5c479a060d27c7d1158dc098560", "ja": "「……ねえ、私にあなたのすべてを教えて……」", "zh": "「……呐，把你的一切都告诉我吧……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "017e2671cb2a7f4748b4042d29d201eed46f63420b9d186ef7e7e924331701d6", "ja": "ううっ、も、ものすごく恥ずかしい……！\nい、今のは、忘れてください！", "zh": "呜呜，好、好羞耻……！\n刚、刚才那个，请忘掉吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b6c480f5b0d5b4cb385a2cbcea2756f7db36a4deb49e59c0315b923a0e341111", "ja": "いやいや、すごく様になってるじゃないか！\nセクシーさだけじゃなくて、カッコ良さもあるぞ！", "zh": "哪有，明明就非常像模像样嘛！\n不仅性感，而且还很帅气哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3288a944fbf370d42e7da8de14ca10fbf6978ee63922b5340c2cafa6a3a53869", "ja": "本気の風花は、そんな迫力も出せるんだな。\nうっかり何でも喋っちゃいそうだよ。", "zh": "认真的风花也能展现出这样的气势啊。\n感觉一不小心就会把什么都说出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4aff608a9625c356572c85be8f5e2fdd0dcc48fd1049ea1b3457879dd7debd82", "ja": "な、何言ってるんですか！　もう……。\nあ、でも……少しだけ自信が付いたかも……ふふ。", "zh": "你、你在说什么呀！真是的……\n啊，不过……我好像稍微有了点自信……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1019_satsueisutaffu", "source_sha256": "adc2e66b7ac0bd4b4a59e1cf462ec787a0e064fa538f5c030f0bba10ef2f8bc1", "ja": "そろそろ撮影を開始しますので、\n準備をお願いします。", "zh": "拍摄马上就要开始了，请做好准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "37d572f02fd2b7a8abff024d77ae9a8fac3a8226983d9fc49471e4839b53fa44", "ja": "はい！　あの……{$P$}さん、\nさっきみたいな感じで撮影すればいいんですよね？", "zh": "好的！那个……{$P$}先生，像刚才那样拍摄就可以了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1021_p", "source_sha256": "70a0ad35d0ac859ce0c56d32ff71fb101f5b4306ba74851469917c233e48db3f", "ja": "そうだな。風花になら、全部任せられるよ。\n思うようにやってきてくれ。", "zh": "是啊。要是风花的话，就可以全部交给你了。\n按自己的想法去做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "dd09912f7d3c6561debd531d389db835a0ad8d3bf7e0c2a8f6c7c8fe67a49860", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さんが選んでくれた\n衣装で、セクシースパイの任務、遂行してきます！", "zh": "是！我会穿着{$P$}先生为我挑选的服装，去执行性感间谍的任务！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0223_1023_p", "source_sha256": "101e55ae4fd834d8f87fe783623e6e5c251beae5e6cb42f4615c8c151881d89b", "ja": "（自信を取り戻した風花に、怖いものはない。\n最高のグラビアになるはずだ！）", "zh": "（对于重新找回自信的风花来说，已经没有什么可怕的了。一定能拍出最棒的写真！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
